SUMMARY:Casual Ride (D) - GS Bird in Hand Sticky Bun Ride (24F)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide leader: Jan Zerfoss\
 nSweep: open\nAnticipated Average Pace for D rides: (12-14 mph)\nRoute: [B
