 r**\n\nThis is a Casual D Class ride. The ride leader will ride at the adv
 ertised average speed. This is intended to be a group ride with a no-drop 
 rule as the main goal. The ride leader will do his/her best to keep the gr
 oup together with occasional regroupings and/or splitting into multiple gr
 oups to align to pace capabilities.\n\nPlease do not join this ride if you
  are not willing to ride with the group. If you exceed the posted pace\, y
 ou will be riding by yourself and encouraged to join a faster group. If ma
 intaining a 12-14 mph average is beyond your current ability level\, pleas
 e consider joining a slower ride first.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbu
 ds. Please bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, 
 pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\
 , we require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. 
 Being on Meetup does not mean you are a club member. Join here [Member Sig
